    description: "Layer-1 root-cause family from the connection sweep (connections-sweep 2026-06-08T1900Z). Members: INV-suvil, WI-fuhof, WI-gifat, WI-suvat, WI-botif, WI-vakuh, WI-motug, WI-humok. Orphan members are reparented here; already-parented members are cross-linked (not_duplicate_of) to preserve their existing umbrella."  # cbbe
