  message: "SATISFIED (META-jalur gate-5 crush, 2026-07-19). Clean full drain after WI-humok reparented to parent=null (release-gated quality.* removal, sibling WI-riguh): direct members WI-gifat/WI-vakuh/WI-botif/WI-fuhof done, WI-motug wont_do; cross-linked INV-suvil satisfied, WI-suvat done. MECHANISM: ADR-0039 confidence separation fully materialized — derive_confidence(evidence_type, is_resolved) at Edge.create, the confidence_source bounded-enum (evidence_derived/emitter_constant/composite), per the EVIDENCE_CONFIDENCE_MATRIX/0.30-default/linker-floor; ranking dampeners relocated to rank_score. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (fresh self-survey, corpus scale 136269 edges): 8 DISTINCT confidence values keyed to evidence bands (0.85=71122, 0.4=23423, 0.95=23224, 0.9=14691, 0.8, 0.5, 0.7, 0.75); confidence_source = evidence_derived 120845 (88.7%) / emitter_constant 15424 — a hardcoded-per-emitter world would show ~1-2 values. This is the non-reproduction of the filed repro (WI-suvat: 'EVIDENCE_CONFIDENCE_MATRIX 1/10 rows match observed'). Also DEEP-bakeoff-validated across 8 repos (register pt.3, all confidence items 'moved'). WI-humok's confidence-band concern (reason's tier-names) is resolved by confidence_source; its residual is the release-gated deprecated-quality.reason removal (D9b), tracked standalone."  # 2fa6
